            <column-instance column='[AVG DF MTD growth % (copy)_5515220700258459674]' derivation='User' name='[usr:AVG DF MTD growth % (copy)_5515220700258459674:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
